[0.01,"o","\u001b[92m║\u001b[0m \u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m\u001b[37m\u001b[0m  \u001b[37mIf the context directory is missing, or the required \u001b[0m\u001b[91;40m global.hydra.type \u001b[0m\u001b[37m metadata is not set correctly, later commands would inspect the wrong location or infer the wrong app\u001b[0m\u001b[37m layout.\u001b[0m\r\n"]
